<section class="content-panel content"><p>This page lists the items you can check out from the front desk for free as a resident.</p>
<h2>Rules for Checking Stuff Out</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Red Lock out keys:</strong> Loan period = 1 hour, Additional Hour Fine = $5/hour, Maximum Fine = $50, Damage/Lost fine = $50, Overnight = No</li>
<li><strong>2-wheel carts, 4 wheel carts/flat beds:</strong> Loan period = 4 hours, Additional Hour Fine = $2/hour, Maximum Fine = $50, Damage/Lost fine = $50, Overnight = No</li>
<li><strong>Vacuum Cleaners:</strong> Loan period = 2 hours, Additional Hour Fine = $2/hour, Maximum Fine = $50, Damage/Lost fine = $50, Overnight = No</li>
<li><strong>Misc items (ping pong, pool, sports equipments): </strong>Loan period = 2 hours, Additional Hour Fine = $2/hour, Maximum Fine = $20, Damage/Lost fine = $50, Overnight = Yes</li>
</ul>
<p>Overnight loans are available only if the items are checked out after 10pm, and must be returned by 10am next day.</p>
